{"5062430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Starwake", "steam_appid": 5062430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of a lone starship traveling through a hostile galaxy where every shot matters. Travel across the galaxy, defeat powerful enemy fleets, discover strange sectors, and build a ship capable of surviving the unknown. Take control of your ship by mastering a fast-paced pinball table. Every ball you launch can become the difference between survival and destruction. Every bumper, target, and lane has a purpose:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charge your weapons</strong> to unleash devastating attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore your shields</strong> before enemy fire tears your hull apart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiply your balls</strong> to trigger chaotic chain reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn resources</strong> to upgrade your ship and prepare for tougher encounters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of a lone starship traveling through a hostile galaxy where every shot matters. Travel across the galaxy, defeat powerful enemy fleets, discover strange sectors, and build a ship capable of surviving the unknown. Take control of your ship by mastering a fast-paced pinball table. Every ball you launch can become the difference between survival and destruction. Every bumper, target, and lane has a purpose:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charge your weapons</strong> to unleash devastating attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore your shields</strong> before enemy fire tears your hull apart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiply your balls</strong> to trigger chaotic chain reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><str